# Slice 282: a callable place through a path takes what a named method reference takes: a method of another signature is refused.
Holder:
    fn: f () int
        return: 1
    end: f
end: Holder
fn: takes (int: a) int
    return: a
end: takes
@: Holder\f takes
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
